@DigiCoupon.Customers = /customer
@DigiCoupon.CustomerCoupon = /customercoupon
@DigiCoupon.CouponRedemption = /CouponRedemption
@Token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..MdHmx3KZsGdM40kIId2JRL8pMqQAa1TG_oderGbHxZw

### dashboard get
get {{DigiCoupon.Server_HostAddress}}{{DigiCoupon.Dashboard}}/9/2026-09-25
